l Necklace Bounty","level":45,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Bring 5 Troll Tribal Necklaces to Fraggar Thundermantle in Aerie Peak.","start":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"end":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"rewards":{"xp":3900,"money":6500,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",100]]}},{"id":2881,"name":"Troll Necklace Bounty","level":45,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"You've done it already, but we will continue to accept any troll tribal necklaces you find and are willing to turn in.  By turning them in to me, you'll continue to improve your standing amongst the Wildhammers; if you're willing to fight for us, then we'll be willing to fight for you!I need five troll tribal necklaces for them to count, <name>.","start":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"end":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"rewards":{"xp":390,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",25]]}},{"id":2934,"name":"Undamaged Venom Sac","level":45,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Horde","summary":"Bring an Undamaged Venom Sac to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.","start":{"name":"Apothecary Lydon","kind":"npc","zone":267,"zoneName":"Hillsbrad Foothills","coord":[61.4,19.2]},"end":{"name":"Apothecary Lydon","kind":"npc","zone":267,"zoneName":"Hillsbrad Foothills","coord":[61.4,19.2]},"chain":{"id":"2933","step":2,"length":5},"rewards":{"xp":3900,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Undercity",100]]}},{"id":2988,"name":"Witherbark Cages","level":45,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Check the cages at the two Witherbark villages, then return to Gryphon  Master Talonaxe.","start":{"name":"Gryphon Master Talonaxe","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[9.8,44.4]},"end":{"name":"Gryphon Master Talonaxe","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[9.8,44.4]},"chain":{"id":"2988","step":1,"length":7},"rewards":{"xp":3900,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",100]]}},{"id":8273,"name":"Oran's Gratitude","level":47,"reqLevel":42,"side":"Horde","summary":"Now isn't this interesting? You say you found this tablet on a small, deserted island at The Overlook Cliffs in The Hinterlands, <class>? Very interesting indeed. I thank you for your efforts in this matter. Our Dark Lady shall be very pleased with this discovery. Here, allow me to reward you proportionately.","start":{"name":"Oran Snakewrithe","kind":"npc","zone":1497,"zoneName":"Undercity","coord":[73.4,32.4]},"end":{"name":"Oran Snakewrithe","kind":"npc","zone":1497,"zoneName":"Undercity","coord":[73.4,32.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4200,"money":7000,"choices":[[20643,1]],"items":[],"rep":[["Undercity",50]]}},{"id":2993,"name":"Return to the Hinterlands","level":47,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Speak with Gryphon Master Talonaxe.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Thadius Grimshade","kind":"npc","zone":4,"zoneName":"Blasted Lands","coord":[67,19.4]},"end":{"name":"Gryphon Master Talonaxe","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[9.8,44.4]},"chain":{"id":"2988","step":6,"length":7},"rewards":{"xp":2100,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",50]]}},{"id":2742,"name":"Rin'ji is Trapped!","level":47,"reqLevel":42,"side":"Horde","summary":"Escort Rin'ji out of the Quel'Danil Lodge, then find his hidden secret at the Overlook Cliffs to the east.","start":{"name":"Rin'ji","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[30.6,47]},"end":{"name":"Rin'ji's Secret","kind":"object","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[86.3,59.1]},"chain":{"id":"2742","step":1,"length":2},"rewards":{"xp":4200,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darkspear Trolls",100]]}},{"id":2782,"name":"Rin'ji's Secret","level":47,"reqLevel"