stic Yayo'jin","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[78.8,78.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":485,"name":"Find OOX-09/HL!","level":48,"reqLevel":43,"side":"Both","summary":"Take the distress beacon to Oglethorpe's homing robot at the head of the river in the Hinterlands, near Skulk Rock.","end":{"name":"Homing Robot OOX-09/HL","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[49.4,37.6]},"chain":{"id":"485","step":1,"length":2},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Booty Bay",100],["Bloodsail Buccaneers",-500]]}},{"id":7816,"name":"Gammerita, Mon!","level":48,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill Gammerita and retrieve Katoom's Best Lure from her corpse.Katoom mentioned that Gammerita hangs out on the coast with the other turtles.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Katoom the Angler","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[80.2,81.4]},"end":{"name":"Katoom the Angler","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[80.2,81.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":7829,"name":"Hunt the Savages","level":48,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete.Markhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.","start":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"end":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":7841,"name":"Message to the Wildhammer","level":48,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to slaughter 15 Highvale Outrunners, 15 Highvale Scouts, 15 Highvale Marksman and 15 Highvale Rangers. Return to him when this task is complete.You can find the Highvale high elves at the Quel'Danil Lodge in the northwestern region of the Hinterlands.","type":"PvP","start":{"name":"Otho Moji'ko","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79.2,79]},"end":{"name":"Otho Moji'ko","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79.2,79]},"chain":{"id":"7841","step":1,"length":3},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":836,"name":"Rescue OOX-09/HL!","level":48,"reqLevel":43,"side":"Both","summary":"Escort OOX-09/HL to the shoreline beyond Overlook Cliff, then report to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.","start":{"name":"Homing Robot OOX-09/HL","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[49.4,37.6]},"end":{"name":"Oglethorpe Obnoticus","kind":"npc","zone":33,"zoneName":"Stranglethorn Vale","coord":[28.2,76.2]},"chain":{"id":"485","step":2,"length":2},"rewards":{"xp":5450,"choices":[[9645,1]],"items":[],"rep":[["Booty Bay",150],["Bloodsail Buccaneers",-750]]}},{"id":2877,"name":"Skulk Rock Clean-up","level":48,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Kill 10 Green Sludges and 10 Jade Oozes, and then report back to Fraggar Thundermantle in Aerie Peak.","start":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"end":{"name":"Fraggar Thundermantle","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[14.8,44.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":5000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",100]]}},{"id":7828,"name":"Stalking the Stalkers","level":48,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Silvermane Stalkers and 15 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete.Markhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands.","start":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"end":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":2989,"name":"The Altar of Zul","level":48,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Check the top of the Altar of Zul, then return to Gryphon Master Talonaxe.","start":{"name":"Gryphon Master Talonaxe","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[9.8,44.4]},"end":{"name":"Gryphon Master Talonaxe","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[9.8,44.4]},"chain":{"id":"2988","step":2,"length":7},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Wildhammer Clan",100]]}},{"id":7839,"name":"Vilebranch Hooligans","level":48,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Smith Slagtree at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Slagtree's Lost Tools. Return to him once this task is complete.You recall Smith Slagtree mentioning that the tools might be at one of the Vilebranch temples in the northeastern region of the Hinterlands. You should also check Skulk Rock.","start":{"name":"Smith Slagtree","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[77.6,80.2]},"end":{"name":"Smith Slagtree","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[77.6,80.2]},"rewards":{"xp":4400,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":7840,"name":"Lard Lost His Lunch","level":49,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Lard at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to find Lard's Lunch. Return to him when this task is complete.Lard mentioned that he left it on the island to the north. Watch out for Vilebranch trolls.","start":{"name":"Lard","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[78.2,81.2]},"end":{"name":"Lard","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[78.2,81.2]},"rewards":{"xp":4550,"money":14000,"choices":[],"items":[[19035,1]],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",100]]}},{"id":7850,"name":"Dark Vessels","level":50,"reqLevel":46,"side":"Horde","summary":"Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Primal Torntusk","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[78.2,81.2]},"end":{"name":"Primal Torntusk","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[78.2,81.2]},"rewards":{"xp":5900,"choices":[],"items":[[19118,1]],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",150]]}},{"id":7849,"name":"Separation Anxiety","level":50,"reqLevel":46,"side":"Horde","summary":"Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple.","type":"Elite","start":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"end":{"name":"Huntsman Markhor","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[79,79.4]},"rewards":{"xp":5900,"money":14500,"choices":[[19117,1]],"items":[],"rep":[["Revantusk Trolls",150]]}},{"id":7815,"name":"Snapjaws, Mon!","level":50,"reqLevel":44,"side":"Horde","summary":"Katoom the Angler at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 15 Saltwater Snapjaw turtles. Return to him when you have completed this task.","start":{"name":"Katoom the Angler","kind":"npc","zone":47,"zoneName":"The Hinterlands","coord":[80.2,81.4]},"end":{"name":"Katoom the Angler","kind